# "This spell costs {1} less to cast if you control a Spirit": Bot1's Mausoleum Wanderer is a Spirit, so two Moxen pay for the
# {2}{U} Snare (the pool is empty right after the cast: not one more, not one less) aimed at a creature spell. Bot2 pays the
# {3} by tapping three Moxen while it resolves (its pool empty after: exactly {3}), so the Ornithopter is not countered.

